message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below, and cite the paper (submitted to ESANN 2027,
  under review) if you use the method.
title: "Neural Fourier Head (NFH): code, results and reproduction scripts"
abstract: >-
  Output layer for multi-step forecasting networks that replaces the final dense layer and writes each forecast as a
  polynomial trend, Fourier harmonics and a residual in orthogonal subspaces, with an exact and unique decomposition.
  The repository contains the nfh library, the code and stored results of the main study, of the control with the
  same extra epochs and of a pre-registered backbone sweep, and the scripts that recompute every reported number.
type: software
